{"id":"n78334-1-8","stage":4,"title":"참치 · 金枪鱼","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78334-1-8-1","ko":"김치찌개에 넣을 돼지고기가 없네.","zh":"没有猪肉可以放进泡菜汤里了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김치찌개에","meaning":"辛奇汤","explanation":"김치찌개：辛奇汤；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"김치찌개","audio":"/audio/e6e7a11ea9665e3ff8c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32543","senseId":"1","lemma":"김치찌개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김치찌개에","audio":"/audio/a70863085f8528ebf0ad.mp3"}},{"text":"넣을","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣을","audio":"/audio/e5bba9305284ac42aae8.mp3"}},{"text":"돼지고기가","meaning":"猪肉","explanation":"돼지고기：猪肉；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돼지고기","audio":"/audio/c7a71714bbf64819b816.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89811","senseId":"1","lemma":"돼지고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼지고기가","audio":"/audio/eff7a49196ad8ad12669.mp3"}},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없네","audio":"/audio/40299a69ec2e93a5e2b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e6e7a11ea9665e3f","term":"김치찌개","zh":"辛奇汤","audio":"/audio/e6e7a11ea9665e3ff8c6.mp3","entryId":"32543","definition":"将辛奇和肉片等放到一起煮制而成的汤。","pronunciation":["김치찌개"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"c7a71714bbf64819","term":"돼지고기","zh":"猪肉","audio":"/audio/c7a71714bbf64819b816.mp3","entryId":"89811","definition":"可食用的猪的肉。","pronunciation":["돼ː지고기"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/84b862f54bce904c7df6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78334-1-8-2","ko":"참치를 넣고 찌개를 끓여도 맛있어요.","zh":"就算加金枪鱼煮汤，也会很好吃的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"참치를","meaning":"金枪鱼","explanation":"참치：金枪鱼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"참치","audio":"/audio/7aefc65dc710f31aa669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78334","senseId":"1","lemma":"참치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참치를","audio":"/audio/d10f4dd7704f4b912b53.mp3"}},{"text":"넣고","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣고","audio":"/audio/bc9dd322908f47e194c3.mp3"}},{"text":"찌개를","meaning":"浓汤，汤，锅","explanation":"찌개：浓汤，汤，锅；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"찌개","audio":"/audio/ab54be0a69403de061db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26901","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찌개를","audio":"/audio/7d00e7b857e44c7781d8.mp3"}},{"text":"끓여도","meaning":"煮，烧","explanation":"끓이다：煮，烧；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"끓이다","audio":"/audio/e0e928624bcebfda14ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59474","senseId":"2","lemma":"끓이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끓여도","audio":"/audio/4f1b72174badd4151d4f.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있어요.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있어요","audio":"/audio/d2df2197e887a0da537c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7aefc65dc710f31a","term":"참치","zh":"金枪鱼","audio":"/audio/7aefc65dc710f31aa669.mp3","entryId":"78334","definition":"一种可食用海鱼，身长3米左右，背部呈青色，肉呈暗红色，主要用来制作生鱼片或罐头食品。","pronunciation":["참치"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"ab54be0a69403de0","term":"찌개","zh":"浓汤，汤，锅","audio":"/audio/ab54be0a69403de061db.mp3","entryId":"26901","definition":"一种微咸的菜肴，在容器中放入少量汤汁后放入肉、豆腐或蔬菜等食材，再放入适量的辣椒酱或大酱等作料和酱油煮制而成。","pronunciation":["찌개"]},{"id":"e0e928624bcebfda","term":"끓이다","zh":"煮，烧","audio":"/audio/e0e928624bcebfda14ca.mp3","entryId":"59474","definition":"把食物放进水或液体里加热，制作食品。","pronunciation":["끄리다"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d7639ba50280ac8091d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.425,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78334","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没有猪肉可以放进泡菜汤里了。","就算加金枪鱼煮汤，也会很好吃的。","我想要给手机充电，你有充电器吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没有猪肉可以放进泡菜汤里了。","就算加金枪鱼煮汤，也会很好吃的。","我想要给手机充电，你有充电器吗？"],"answer":1}]}
